        "created_at": "2016-04-15T14:35:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>MigrantP laid out what kind of card and target the Heroic Infinitor variant is on the Steam forums</p>\n<div>\n[quote=\"MigrantP\"]\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>On Heroic Infinitor's front side:</div><ul>\n<li> He is a villain card. He is not a hero card. </li>\n<li> He is a character card, and the villain character card. He is not a hero character card. </li>\n<li> He is a hero target. He is not a villain target. </li>\n<li> He is a non-villain target. He is not a non-hero target. </li>\n</ul><div>&nbsp;</div><div>On Heroic Infinity's flip side:</div><ul><li> Works the same as any other villain.  </li></ul>\n<p>[/quote]</p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:18.803Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
