        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "MigrantP laid out what kind of card and target the Heroic Infinitor variant is on the Steam forums\n<div>\n[quote=\"MigrantP\"]\n</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>On Heroic Infinitor&#39;s front side:</div><ul><li> He is a villain card. He is not a hero card. </li><li> He is a character card, and the villain character card. He is not a hero character card. </li><li> He is a hero target. He is not a villain target. </li><li> He is a non-villain target. He is not a non-hero target. </li></ul><div>&nbsp;</div><div>On Heroic Infinity&#39;s flip side:</div><ul><li> Works the same as any other villain.  </li></ul>\n \n[/quote]\n \n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
