        "created_at": "2016-04-15T15:48:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<blockquote>\n<p>He is not a villain target.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>While the rest seems reasonable, that one is counterintuitive to me. If he is a villain card and a target, I don’t see why he wouldn’t be a villain target.</p>\n<p>But hey, now we know!</p>",
