        "raw": "> He is not a villain target.\n\r\nWhile the rest seems reasonable, that one is counterintuitive to me. If he is a villain card and a target, I don't see why he wouldn't be a villain target.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBut hey, now we know!",
